  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farclightsmp.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://files.catbox.moe/ikdage.gif\" width=\"468\" height=\"60\"></a><br><strong>廣告：</strong> Arclight SMP - 隨心所欲，但須知他人亦能如此。包含自訂生態域、300多種建築、危險生物、自訂附魔、技能、可復活寵物，以及城鎮。在領地外允許PvP與掠奪。實驗性太空探索（可能保留或移除）。唯一規則：禁止作弊。<br><strong>Java（1.9-1.21.11）：</strong> play.arclightsmp.com | <strong>基岩版：</strong> 連接埠 19199<br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>無邊框玻璃是一款簡單輕量的資源包，能移除所有玻璃方塊的邊框，強化您的Minecraft體驗。告別那些惱人的邊框，在建築中享受更潔淨、更沉浸的玻璃外觀。此資源包支援多種Minecraft版本，您可依遊戲版本選擇合適的下載。立即下載，讓您的玻璃方塊擁有流暢無縫的外觀！</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/JtZ7K577Pt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#36f\"><strong>加入 Discord 伺服器</strong></span></a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>此外，也請看看：&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<br></strong></span></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mahis-connected-grass\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mahi的連接草地</a><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mahis-better-sky\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mahi的更佳天空</a><br><br></strong></span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/deadworld-survival-zombie-apocalypse\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>DeadWorld 生存：殭屍啟示錄（模組包）：</strong></a><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/deadworld-survival-zombie-apocalypse\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在一個充滿敵意的世界中，於無情的殭屍啟示錄中存活。每個聲音、氣味與光線都可能引來危險。你將配備現代武器，需要策略與技巧才能在這嚴酷環境與不斷逼近的屍潮中生存。<br></a><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/845743/description_db3e065c-2342-493e-a8ca-77806fcf771e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"487\"></strong></span></p>",
